  "description": "A staff favourite, this Lowdown LTD in Cloud will have you dreaming about riding rowdy lines and boosting kickers. The limited edition paint job is one of only 6 frames ever produced. Heads will turn while you float by on your Cloud coloured bike with a top of the line SRAM XO transmission drivetrain and Ultimate Rockshox suspension.\n\nThe Lowdown is ready to shred steep lines and gaps, smash berms, or head out on long distance missions. Its a trail bike that eats up chunder and drops while being ready for all day pedal adventures. It takes everything we learned developing our full suspension line and directs it into a long travel bruiser!",
